homelab-ansible-inventory
__pycache__
inventory
simoncaron.pve_permissions
*.retry
terraform.tfvars
.terraform
.terraform.lock.*
terraform.tfstate*
kubespray-repo
.ansible
*-private.yaml
kompose-manifests
cup.json
*.env
*.pem
*.csr
wazuh-kubernetes
context
*.log
ca.key
# App config folders only symlink the CA key, a pre-commit hook blocks real copies
!**/config/static/**/ca.key
termix_hosts.json
cacerts
autokuma-monitors

# Helm: dependency archives, lock files and interrupted-update leftovers are
# re-created by `helm dependency update`, never commit them
**/charts/*.tgz
**/tmpcharts-*/
Chart.lock
